   "originalText": "\u00b7 scaling out does not help Bob \u2014 his state was\n  only ever on the box that died\n\u00b7 deploys are disruptive: draining a box means\n  waiting out every session pinned to it\n\u00b7 the LB now has to remember routing decisions",
